  "notes": "TJLabs maps original Boston service codes into three internal review groups using the retained 12 October 2026 catalogue and case observations. The source service names and full request objects remain attached. GeoReport v2 updated_datetime is interpreted as case-closure time only when the original status is closed; retained status_notes explains the disposition. The weekday calendar and four-hour internal-review target are operator configuration. Source expected_datetime remains a separate optional field. Review the receiving team's dates, working hours, holidays and origin before selecting a target."
